{
  "uid": "e2e-latency",
  "title": "Order pipeline - where is the time going?",
  "tags": [
    "kafka",
    "e2e",
    "tracing",
    "latency"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Where does an order spend its time? (metrics)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Where does an order spend its time? (average per message, STACKED = end-to-end)",
      "description": "Each colour is one piece of an order's journey. The 'wait in topic' pieces are the GAPS of the trace waterfall: replication + queue behind the consumer lag. If a wait band grows, the consumer is the bottleneck (not the broker); if a work band grows, the app code is slow.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_sum{topic=\"orders\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_count{topic=\"orders\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "1. wait in topic orders",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_sum{stage=\"processor\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_count{stage=\"processor\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "2. processor work",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_sum{topic=\"orders.processed\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_count{topic=\"orders.processed\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "3. wait in topic orders.processed",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_sum{stage=\"sink\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_count{stage=\"sink\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4. sink work",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Slowest part right now (p95)",
      "description": "Same four pieces, p95 over the last minute. The longest bar is where to look first.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_bucket{topic=\"orders\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "wait in orders",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_bucket{stage=\"processor\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "processor work",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_bucket{topic=\"orders.processed\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "wait in orders.processed",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(demo_stage_processing_seconds_bucket{stage=\"sink\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "sink work",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "End-to-end latency distribution (heatmap)",
      "description": "Each column is one minute; the colour is how many orders landed in that latency bucket. A single fast band = healthy; a smear going up = queueing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(demo_end_to_end_latency_seconds_bucket[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "s",
          "axisPlacement": "left"
        },
        "color": {
          "scheme": "Turbo",
          "mode": "scheme",
          "fill": "dark-orange",
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "steps": 64
        },
        "cellGap": 1,
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "yHistogram": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Wait in topic, p95 (per topic)",
      "description": "Time between the broker accepting the record and this consumer receiving it. Rises when the consumer falls behind (try scenario A / a slow processor).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, topic) (rate(demo_topic_wait_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Same story from the TRACES (Tempo metrics generator turns spans into metrics)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Service map (from traces)",
      "description": "Built by Tempo from the spans: nodes = services, edges = a PRODUCER span paired with the CONSUMER span of the same trace. Needs a few minutes of traffic after the first deploy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "serviceMap",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 duration per span (from traces)",
      "description": "traces_spanmetrics_latency: how long each step takes INSIDE a service, as seen in the spans. A flat line per span = predictable; a rising one = that step is your bottleneck.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=~\"order-.*\", span_name=~\".*(process|validate|notification)\"}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} \u00b7 {{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Span rate (from traces)",
      "description": "traces_spanmetrics_calls_total: spans per second per step. The shape must match across the steps: a step that falls below the others is dropping or lagging.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"order-.*\", span_name=~\".*(process|send|create order)\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} \u00b7 {{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TraceQL metrics: p95 of 'validate and enrich order' (computed by Tempo, no Prometheus)",
      "description": "TraceQL can aggregate spans on the fly: { ... } | quantile_over_time(duration, .95). Same data as the span metrics, but you can filter by ANY span attribute.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"order-processor\" && name = \"validate and enrich order\" } | quantile_over_time(duration, .95)",
          "metricsQueryType": "range",
          "limit": 20,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Order of reading:** (1) the stacked chart says WHICH piece of the journey grew; (2) the heatmap says whether it is EVERY order or only a tail;\n(3) the service map and span panels confirm it with the traces; (4) open one slow trace (Explore -> Tempo) and look for the long span or the empty gap.\n\n**Wait in topic** is not a span: the broker emits none, so it appears in a trace only as the gap between `send` and `process`. This dashboard turns that gap into a number\n(`demo_topic_wait_seconds`, measured by the consumer from the record timestamp). **Work** is the time the code itself spent (`demo_stage_processing_seconds`).\nTry it: scenario A of the README (stop the processor) makes the *wait in orders* band grow while *work* stays flat."
      }
    }
  ]
}